    title: "Log Entries"
    description: "Application log samples with raw multiline content."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "{\n  application: \"models\"\n  log_format: \"structured\"\n  # Example stack trace\n  sample_error: \"\"\"\nError: If we navigate the application, we can get to the JBOD system through the digital UDP monitor!\n    at /srv/ethyl_bicycle_delightfully.xml:184\n    at /var/tmp/aw.mpga:389\n    at process.main (node:internal/main:1:1)\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Sample HTTP request\n  sample_request: \"\"\"\nPUT /api/lay HTTP/1.1\nHost: formal-story.net\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; SM-T800) AppleWebKit/539.8 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/117.4.1.3 Mobile Safari/549.21\nAccept: application/json\n\"\"\"\n  retention_days: 32\n}"
