  {
    num: "5566"
    title: "Blog Post"
    description: "A blog post with metadata and content sections."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Colligo trepide venia beatus.\"\n  slug: \"spoliatio-arcus-voro\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Ms. Misty Schowalter\"\n    avatar: \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/faker-js/assets-person-portrait/male/512/31.jpg\"\n    bio: \"section devotee  🥫\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-03-03\"\n  tags: [\n    \"hutch\"\n    \"sonata\"\n    \"dream\"\n  ]\n\n  published: true\n  reading_time: \"17 min\"\n  summary: \"Asperiores aeneus in. Ter approbo curia subvenio tutis temporibus coma cattus quam temporibus. Videlicet viscus tam suffragium.\"\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5567"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Shakshuka\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"27 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"119 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 lbs miso\"\n    \"2 pieces white rice\"\n    \"3 cups pumpkin seed\"\n    \"1 lbs avocado\"\n    \"2 pieces achacha\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Juicy ostrich, grilled to your liking and drizzled with a bold vanilla sauce, served alongside roasted sun dried tomatoes.\"\n    \"A simple tangelo pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"Baked morwong-stuffed beef, seasoned with allspice and savory herbs, accompanied by roasted peppers medley.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 576\n    protein: \"20g\"\n    carbs: \"92g\"\n    fat: \"24g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5568"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Banana-glazed Crocodile Skewers\"\n  servings: 2\n  prep_time: \"13 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"114 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 tbsp borlotti beans\"\n    \"3 lbs raisin\"\n    \"1 cups sweet chilli sauce\"\n    \"1 cups tangelo\"\n    \"4 tsp blue cheese\"\n    \"1 oz barberry\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A special silver soy sauce from India. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of kaffir leaves.\"\n    \"A succulent pork steak, encased in a salty turmeric crust, served with a side of jerk mashed broccolini.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of crispy garlic, complemented by cherry and methi.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 380\n    protein: \"10g\"\n    carbs: \"36g\"\n    fat: \"24g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5569"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Juicy Celery Curry\"\n  servings: 2\n  prep_time: \"43 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"115 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 tsp bocconcini\"\n    \"2 pieces beetroot\"\n    \"2 tbsp lobster\"\n    \"3 tsp camomile\"\n    \"1 cups cottage cheese\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A delightful tart combining salty purple carrot and sweet olive, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of rosemary.\"\n    \"Tender pigeon skewers, glazed with a sweet and tangy incaberry sauce, served over a bed of fragrant jasmine rice.\"\n    \"Crispy fried turkey bites, seasoned with caraway seed and served with a tangy mangosteen dipping sauce.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 509\n    protein: \"20g\"\n    carbs: \"24g\"\n    fat: \"37g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5570"
    title: "Dashboard Layout"
    description: "Dashboard widget layout configuration."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Thiel and Sons Dashboard\"\n  refresh_interval: 60 # seconds\n  widgets: [\n    {\n      type: \"chart\"\n      title: \"Traffic\"\n      source: \"/api/metrics/revenue\"\n      chart_type: \"bar\"\n      period: \"7d\"\n    }\n\n    {\n      type: \"stat\"\n      title: \"Total Users\"\n      source: \"/api/stats/users\"\n      format: \"number\"\n    }\n\n    {\n      type: \"table\"\n      title: \"Recent Orders\"\n      source: \"/api/recent/signups\"\n      limit: 20\n    }\n  ]\n\n  theme: \"light\"\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5571"
    title: "Playlist"
    description: "A music playlist with tracks and metadata."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  name: \"Heavy Metal Favorites\"\n  curator: \"Steven Hilpert\"\n  public: false\n  tracks: [\n    {\n      title: \"Money For Nothing\"\n      artist: \"Bradly Rolfson II\"\n      album: \"tutamen\"\n      duration: \"2:21\"\n    }\n\n    {\n      title: \"Stars & Stripes Forever\"\n      artist: \"Ann Grimes\"\n      album: \"cotidie caries undique\"\n      duration: \"3:37\"\n    }\n\n    {\n      title: \"Pennies From Heaven\"\n      artist: \"Pamela Rosenbaum\"\n      album: \"alo\"\n      duration: \"4:06\"\n    }\n\n    {\n      title: \"Louie Louie\"\n      artist: \"Emmitt Zboncak V\"\n      album: \"dapifer volaticus\"\n      duration: \"3:49\"\n    }\n  ]\n\n  total_duration: \"47min\"\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5572"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Risotto With Seafood\"\n  servings: 4\n  prep_time: \"30 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"116 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 oz cacao\"\n    \"1 pieces purple carrot\"\n    \"4 tbsp berries\"\n    \"1 pieces beef stock\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"3-day aged emu steak, with choice of 4 sides.\"\n    \"A simple melon pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"A simple lime pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious salmon and golden kidney beans, baked in a delicious pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"A moist zucchini creation, seasoned with balti masala and thyme, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"Crispy fried emu bites, seasoned with rose baie and served with a tangy guava dipping sauce.\"\n    \"Three cassia bark with dried chinese broccoli, celery, cos lettuce, swiss chard and sea salt. With a side of baked sprout, and your choice of peanuts or soy beans.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 738\n    protein: \"10g\"\n    carbs: \"14g\"\n    fat: \"13g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "5573"
