    description: "A blog post with metadata and content sections."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Vobis compono ullus agnitio aequitas soleo umquam.\"\n  slug: \"caries-agnosco-uter\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Alberto McClure\"\n    avatar: \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/faker-js/assets-person-portrait/female/512/68.jpg\"\n    bio: \"filmmaker\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-04-21\"\n  tags: [\n    \"hornet\"\n    \"eggplant\"\n    \"confusion\"\n  ]\n\n  published: true\n  reading_time: \"6 min\"\n  summary: \"Aestus arguo volubilis termes vacuus utrimque volo conor. Correptius cohors modi voro solium adicio despecto verecundia deorsum ex. Suggero taedium confido eveniet harum attollo cruentus.\"\n}"
