    title: "Log Entries"
    description: "Application log samples with raw multiline content."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "{\n  application: \"networks\"\n  log_format: \"structured\"\n  # Example stack trace\n  sample_error: \"\"\"\nError: If we synthesize the pixel, we can get to the PCI firewall through the auxiliary SMTP driver!\n    at /var/log/fast.so:332\n    at /var/tmp/fooey_sheepishly.txt:314\n    at process.main (node:internal/main:1:1)\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Sample HTTP request\n  sample_request: \"\"\"\nGET /api/outset HTTP/1.1\nHost: brilliant-joy.org\nUser-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; MSIE 7.0; Windows NT 5.1; Trident/6.0)\nAccept: application/json\n\"\"\"\n  retention_days: 67\n}"
