    description: "A blog post with metadata and content sections."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Velit amo cubitum contego laudantium.\"\n  slug: \"civis-utpote-tenax\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Raymundo Prohaska\"\n    avatar: \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/faker-js/assets-person-portrait/male/512/93.jpg\"\n    bio: \"blogger\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-06-19\"\n  tags: [\n    \"haversack\"\n    \"coast\"\n    \"cinder\"\n  ]\n\n  published: false\n  reading_time: \"13 min\"\n  summary: \"Et cultellus deludo votum supellex aedificium deprecator xiphias. Ubi textor similique illum tersus ea. Tamisium ustulo deinde compono vinco subvenio.\"\n}"
