    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Capto cuius tremo suggero provident cultura allatus.\"\n  slug: \"mollitia-creator-cicuta\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Marty Legros\"\n    avatar: \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/faker-js/assets-person-portrait/female/512/73.jpg\"\n    bio: \"entrepreneur, teacher, person\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-06-17\"\n  tags: [\n    \"ceramics\"\n    \"marathon\"\n    \"ecliptic\"\n  ]\n\n  published: false\n  reading_time: \"10 min\"\n  summary: \"Cupio quod concido et thesis perspiciatis curiositas cunae denego tracto. Viscus victus vilis paens subnecto cohibeo confido peccatus crepusculum censura. Callide argumentum animi articulus allatus consequatur similique cubicularis.\"\n}"
