    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Aspicio occaecati tergeo odio impedit confugo creta adnuo.\"\n  slug: \"colo-ater-asper\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Ceasar Kuhic\"\n    avatar: \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61127327\"\n    bio: \"unibody lover\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-05-25\"\n  tags: [\n    \"someplace\"\n    \"casket\"\n    \"heating\"\n  ]\n\n  published: false\n  reading_time: \"13 min\"\n  summary: \"Vulpes sum acidus approbo peccatus antiquus tepidus uredo constans tutis. Vulgaris asper utique tardus quibusdam absorbeo varius cometes ulciscor ea. Vilicus recusandae doloremque super adfero thymbra absum compono tribuo verto.\"\n}"
